
📘 Madhuram API Documentation – Sample Module
Overview
The Sample API in Madhuram manages sample records for projects, including:
Uploading multiple sample files
Fetching samples (all / by project / by ID)
Updating sample details
Deleting sample records
✅ Base URL: /api/sample
✅ Upload Directory: /uploads/sample
✅ Database Table: samples
✅ JSON fields stored as stringified JSON:
location
item_description
add_fields

