✅ Endpoints

1) Upload Multiple Files for Sample
POST /api/sample/upload
Uploads multiple files and returns an array of file paths.
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
Form Data
Field
Type
Required
Notes
file
file[]
✅
Multiple files allowed

Success Response (200)
{
  "filePaths": [
    "/uploads/sample/170687123-123456789.pdf",
    "/uploads/sample/170687125-987654321.jpg"
  ]
}

Error Response (400)
{ "error": "No files uploaded" }

✅ Note: This API only uploads and returns file paths. It does not create a sample record.

2) Get All Samples
GET /api/sample
Returns all sample records ordered by latest first.
Success Response (200)
[
  {
    "sample_id": 1,
    "project_id": 10,
    "building_name": "Tower A",
    "site_name": "Madhuram Site",
    "location": { "city": "Mumbai" },
    "created_at": "2026-02-18T10:00:00.000Z"
  }
]

Error Response (500)
{ "error": "Internal Server Error" }


