Error Response (404)
{ "error": "Sample not found" }


6) Delete Sample
DELETE /api/sample/{id}
Deletes a sample record by ID.
Success Response (200)
{ "message": "Sample deleted successfully" }

Error Response (404)
{ "error": "Sample not found" }


